# Keep secrets and local junk out of the published images.
# Without this, `COPY backend/ /app/` bakes backend/.env — real keys — into
# every image we ship, and an empty compose variable then shadows the box's own.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.git
**/.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/build
**/.pytest_cache
**/test_reports
**/memory
appliance/data
backend/uploads
backend/backups
